# Egress supervisor secrets (TEMPLATE, committed as names only).
# Real values go in tools/egress/.env (same file, NEVER committed — gitignored).
#
# - EGRESS_SUB_URL ... your v2ray subscription: either the https:// subscription
#   URL (supervisor refreshes it) or the raw base64 body pasted inline.
#   YOU paste your own link here; nothing ships with the repo.
# - EGRESS_SUP_TOKEN . Bearer token for the loopback API. Generate one with:
#     python tools/egress/supervisor.py --gen-token
#   then paste it here AND export EGRESS_SUP_TOKEN for clients.
#
# Phase 1 needs neither: direct-mode leases (AvalAI/domestic targets) work
# with no VPN and no tunnel. Tunnels (xray children) arrive in phase 2.

EGRESS_SUB_URL=
EGRESS_SUP_TOKEN=
